Sure! Here's a simple function that maps values from 0 to 1 using a combination of smooth and linear segments:

```javascript
function smoothLinearMap(x) {
  const alpha = 0.5; // Adjust this value for the smoothness of the transition
  const beta = 0.5; // Adjust this value for the steepness of the linear segment

  if (x <= alpha) {
    return x * x; // Smooth segment
  } else if (x >= 1 - alpha) {
    return (1 - x) * (1 - x); // Smooth segment
  } else {
    return beta * (x - alpha); // Linear segment
  }
}
```

