        echo "Customer ID: " . $row["customer_id"]. " - Purchase Count: " . $row["purchase_count"]. "<br>";
    }
} else {
    echo "0 results";
}
$conn->close();
?>
```

This code will display a list of loyal customers who have purchased the specified product at least three times within the last week

